msgstr "Dealer Inventory for AutoScout24"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid "https://github.com/drilonsaiti/dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24"
msgstr "https://github.com/drilonsaiti/dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24"

#. Description of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid ""
"Show a car dealer's AutoScout24 stock on their own WordPress site: synced "
"locally, fast, crawlable and fully styleable."
msgstr ""
"Affiche le stock AutoScout24 d’un garage sur son propre site WordPress : "
"synchronisé localement, rapide, indexable et entièrement personnalisable."

#. Author of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid "Drilon Saiti"
msgstr "Drilon Saiti"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid "https://drilonsaiti.github.io/"
msgstr "https://drilonsaiti.github.io/"

#: includes/class-admin.php:58
msgid ""
"Our vehicle listings are provided by AutoScout24 (SMG Swiss Marketplace "
"Group AG). Vehicle photos are loaded directly from the AutoScout24 image "
"server (images.autoscout24.ch); your browser therefore sends your IP address"
" and browser information to that server. Links to vehicles lead to "
"autoscout24.ch."
msgstr ""
"Nos annonces de véhicules proviennent d’AutoScout24 (SMG Swiss Marketplace "
"Group AG). Les photos sont chargées directement depuis le serveur d’images "
"d’AutoScout24 (images.autoscout24.ch) ; votre navigateur transmet donc votre"
" adresse IP et des informations sur le navigateur à ce serveur. Les liens "
"vers les véhicules mènent à autoscout24.ch."

#. translators: %s: URL of the SMG privacy policy.
#: includes/class-admin.php:61
#, php-format
msgid "Privacy policy of SMG Swiss Marketplace Group: %s"
msgstr "Politique de confidentialité de SMG Swiss Marketplace Group : %s"

